  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 4 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nStep into this beautifully updated, sun-filled home in the heart of Takapuna. An appealing opportunity for first-home buyers, downsizers and investors, this move-in-ready home offers the perfect blend of modern style, low maintenance living and flexible space, all in one of the North Shore’s most sought-after suburbs.\r\n\r\nUpstairs is warm and inviting, with two comfortable bedrooms, a well-appointed kitchen and relaxed, light-filled living. The classic brick construction and easy-care grounds mean less time on upkeep and more time enjoying the Takapuna lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe real bonus is the equal-sized downstairs level. This large space comes with a separate laundry and its own toilet. Use it as a home office, creative studio, teenage retreat or extra living space. It gives you real versatility as your needs change.\r\n\r\nStep outside to your fully fenced and fully decked private garden, where you can relax, entertain family and friends, or simply enjoy the afternoon and evening sun in a peaceful outdoor setting.\r\n\r\nThe location is hard to beat. Smales Farm, the Northern Busway station, North Shore Hospital and Takapuna CBD are all within walking distance, and Takapuna Beach, cafés and shopping are just minutes away.\r\n\r\nFor families, the home is in zone for some of Auckland’s most sought-after schools: Takapuna Grammar School, Westlake Boys’ High School, Westlake Girls’ High School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate and Takapuna School. It is also close to Carmel College, Rosmini College and St Joseph’s School (Takapuna).\r\n\r\nDon’t miss this opportunity. Contact us today to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nAll conjunctions welcome!",
